### Per-theorem vacuity read — common foundation (12 new theorems)
Read final complete statements and proofs. None has a conclusion disjunction, so there is no disjunct provable from premises/instance alone that bypasses another obligation. These are not a review of the still-unimplemented constructor port.
- substVarRow_ascending: every row and substitution; preserves label order through actual changed field bodies, not an assumed equal row.
- upVarSubst_typed: original context substitution premise does not assume typing of the lifted substitution; conclusion extends both contexts and shifts supplied terms under a fresh binder.
- substVar_typed: arbitrary source term/context and typed replacement map imply typing of the actual substituted result in the target context; no premise types that result.
- substVarFields_typed: corresponding row judgment, same labels and result types; recursive terms are actually substituted.
- substVarArms_typed: corresponding arm judgment with payload binder lifting, nonempty arm invariant retained.
- substListFn_typed: exact list/context correspondence supplies typing of the looked-up replacement; binds index to the supplied context, no arbitrary existential.
- substList_typed: composes the actual list interpretation and term substitution under a typed source context; no success of the result is assumed.
- substList_lam_capture: concrete free-variable capture tooth, no premise; actual no-lift mutation falsifies it.
- substList_case_capture: concrete payload-binder capture tooth; both no-lift and no-arm-lift mutations falsify it.
