Add the eighteenth term constructor hole n sigma, signature-indexed checking,
capture-avoiding filling and fresh invocation-time selection from pinned rows.
ROM retains typed candidate syntax; unused withdrawn hypotheses strengthen,
used hypotheses suspend, and blocked holes retain their exact typed refusal
without impersonating a selected receipt. Independent guarded management
remains callable. Actual preparation, output size, typing and digest-source
invariants cover the live path; closed APIs retain their specializations.
The authorized langTemplate_no_hyps boundary is replaced by deployed
strengthening, five outcomes, all eight experiments and P8's demanded contextual
atomic transfer. Preserve the closed printer teeth; guard contextual readback.

PRICE PREMISES: none for every other landed theorem. The seven explicitly superseded
contracts (six ref-model contracts and private run_of_program), exact changed meanings and successor teeth are listed below.
The18 closed checker/renaming/deployed-extraction statements are byte-identical
to main; generalized statements have distinct _live names.
Murase context polymorphism and Norell chapter3 motivate the ambient-context
and signature-guard design. No staged fallback or second evaluator.

